Package: com.podpod123.storeloginfix
Name: NewerStoreLoginFix
Version: 1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Tweak to fix the Cannot connect to iTunes Store error by rewriting the request to another endpoint. Will not work on iOS 9+, untested on iOS 7-8.
Maintainer: Pod <pod@podpod123.com>
Author: Pod <pod@podpod123.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 9.0)
